    passwords
    credentials
    secrets
    VM disks
    VM snapshots
    registry dumps
    SAM
    NTDS.dit
    massive command output
    other sensitive or machine-specific state


The repository is intended to explain and reproduce
the infrastructure implementation, not to store
the virtual machines themselves.


