================================================================================
SECURITY
================================================================================

Security is cross-cutting.

It is NOT postponed until the end.


Apply throughout implementation:


    Least Privilege
    Authentication
    Authorization
    Secure defaults
    Firewalling
    Password policies
    Account lockout
    IAM policies
    Secrets management
    Audit logs
    Patch management
    Backups
    Access reviews


Phase 2:


    IAM least-privilege model implemented.


Phase 3:


    Active Directory identity and group-based access
    control implemented.


Advanced security infrastructure remains optional
until justified by the architecture.


